'''Catclaw Castle''' (にゃんこ検定城, ''Nyanko Kentei-jō'', '''Cat Test Castle''') is an animated enemy base that appears in all [[Catclaw Championships]] stages. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Catclaw Castle
|image = E 710.png
|first appearance = [[Rank-Up Test 1 (Rank 1)]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

